    country, only where they differ. Without coordinates HA's location stays as it is: Laib never
    looks an address up. No value reaches the log."""
    lat, lon = E.get("ZUHAUSE_LATITUDE", ""), E.get("ZUHAUSE_LONGITUDE", "")
